var e={days:[{materialId:`1113-英语思维练习`,date:`2026-11-13`,dir:`1113`,title:`Let’s Practice Thinking in English Together`,sourceUrl:`https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sx4OG2S5A4Y`,duration:`00:24:41`,chapters:[{id:`part-1`,index:1,name:`Thinking in English at a Tokyo Park`,start:0,end:88,summary:`Sitting by a lake in Tokyo, the speaker invites viewers to describe photos in slow English without translating in their heads.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-1`,time:0,text:`Do you want to start thinking in English naturally?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-2`,time:4,text:`Then watch this full, slow English podcast to practice your listening and thinking in English.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-3`,time:13,text:`Let's get started.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-4`,time:20,text:`So as you can see, you guys, you can see I'm in a park right now in Tokyo, Japan.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-5`,time:27,text:`Tokyo behind me you can see high-rise apartment buildings there's also a huge`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-6`,time:34,text:`lake right here but you can't really see so I'm sitting down in this park people`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-7`,time:40,text:`are walking around this lake and running around this lake and I'm just here`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-8`,time:46,text:`sitting down on this bench having a slow English conversation with you guys but`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-9`,time:54,text:`the topic of today is Japan. So I'm currently in Japan as I just said in the`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-10`,time:62,text:`beginning of this video. I have some photos on my phone here that I will go`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-11`,time:68,text:`through with you guys and describe everything using clear, slow, natural`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-12`,time:75,text:`English. Throughout the video I want you guys to help me describe every photo and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-13`,time:82,text:`try not to translate in your head. Try to think in English and not in your own`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-14`,time:88,text:`language.`}]},{id:`part-2`,index:2,name:`At the Airport and Arriving in Tokyo`,start:92,end:352,summary:`Airport photos lead into check-in, security, immigration, a layover in Shanghai, two flights, and the long trip to the hotel.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-1`,time:92,text:`Okay, first image. This right`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-2-img-1`,src:`../../materials-assets/1113/part2-boarding-line-0132.png`,alt:`机场登机口排队的旅客（原视频 01:32）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-2`,time:99,text:`here is a photo I took inside an airport. Inside an airport. Why do you go to`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-3`,time:106,text:`airports. You go to airports when you need to fly somewhere either domestically, which means inside`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-4`,time:116,text:`of the same country, or internationally, which means outside of the country. You can see there`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-5`,time:123,text:`are people here standing in line to board the flight. This is the final step before you fly.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-6`,time:131,text:`What are the steps before you get to this point? You first need to arrive at`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-7`,time:138,text:`the airport. You then need to go check in with the airline you're flying with. If`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-8`,time:143,text:`you have bags, this is where you check them in. You call those bags checked`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-2-img-2`,src:`../../materials-assets/1113/part2-airline-check-in-0223.png`,alt:`航空公司值机柜台前的人群（原视频 02:23）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-9`,time:149,text:`luggage. After you check in your luggage, you can bring your hand luggage and your`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-10`,time:154,text:`personal item with you through security. When you go through security, you have to`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-11`,time:160,text:`take off your shoes, your backpack and you have to take the power banks and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-12`,time:165,text:`laptops out of your bags and put them in a separate bin. After that your items go`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-13`,time:172,text:`through an x-ray machine to make sure you're not carrying anything you`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-14`,time:176,text:`shouldn't be onto the airplane. Once you are past security you then need to go`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-15`,time:181,text:`through immigration if you're flying internationally. Immigration stamps you`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-16`,time:187,text:`out of the country. This is required when leaving a country. After you go`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-17`,time:192,text:`through security and immigration, you then enter the airport terminal. From`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-18`,time:198,text:`there, you can head to your boarding gate and wait for your flight to arrive.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-19`,time:202,text:`Those are the simplified steps of going to the airport and boarding your flight.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-20`,time:208,text:`The specific rules depends on the country. For example, some countries`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-21`,time:214,text:`require you to take off your shoes when going through security and other`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-22`,time:218,text:`countries do not. Now let's go to the second photo. This is another line in a`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-23`,time:224,text:`different airport waiting to board the flight. This is in Shanghai. Shanghai,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-24`,time:230,text:`China. This was a layover stop. That means it wasn't my final destination but it`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-25`,time:237,text:`was a place that I had to stop before getting on another plane to go to my`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-26`,time:242,text:`final destination. And here is a picture of my final destination. This is in Tokyo, Japan at the`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-27`,time:251,text:`international airport. You can see the characters there are Japanese characters. Now that train ride`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-28`,time:260,text:`was very long and tiring. I woke up at 2am to catch my flight to go to Tokyo and I arrived`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-29`,time:268,text:`in Tokyo at 12 p.m and I had two flights and each flight was about two and a half hours long`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-30`,time:275,text:`so I didn't really get much sleep. I think I slept two hours on the first flight and two and a half`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-31`,time:282,text:`hours on the second flight for a total of four and a half hours so I was very tired when I landed in Tokyo.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-32`,time:296,text:`It's a little windy out here hopefully the audio is nice and clear. Let me know in the`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-33`,time:302,text:`comments if you guys want me to hold the mic like this from now on during my podcast episodes`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-34`,time:309,text:`and during my regular vlogs if it's clearer for you guys. So anyway it took about an hour and 45`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-35`,time:318,text:`minutes to get from the airport to our hotel. It was very far because the airport we landed at in`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-36`,time:324,text:`Japan is very far outside of Tokyo so it was kind of annoying but at least it`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-37`,time:332,text:`wasn't at 12 a.m. because I think at that point there wouldn't have been any`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-38`,time:337,text:`trains and we would have had to pay $200 for a taxi to our hotel $200`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-39`,time:345,text:`compared to the $14 we had to pay for the train but this is the part that I'm`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-40`,time:352,text:`I'm excited to tell you guys about.`}]},{id:`part-3`,index:3,name:`The First Meal in Japan`,start:354,end:438,summary:`The brothers eat beef, curry, rice, and miso soup. The speaker describes the quick service and the price.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-1`,time:354,text:`This was our first meal in Japan.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-2`,time:357,text:`We did stop at a convenience store`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-3`,time:359,text:`when we arrived at our hotel`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-4`,time:361,text:`and we had some convenience store food.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-5`,time:367,text:`but this was our first real meal.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-6`,time:370,text:`You can see I got beef with onions and rice`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-7`,time:373,text:`and I also got beef curry and miso soup.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-8`,time:377,text:`And this I believe is like Japanese fast food.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-9`,time:380,text:`I believe it's Japanese fast food`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-10`,time:382,text:`because it came out in like 60 seconds.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-11`,time:386,text:`We ordered and then our food was there.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-12`,time:388,text:`And I was like, this is some good service.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-13`,time:391,text:`Like this was very fast.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-14`,time:392,text:`I was quite pleased at the speed that our food was served.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-15`,time:398,text:`But here in the image,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-16`,time:399,text:`you can see my brother and I got essentially the same meal.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-17`,time:404,text:`We both got that beef with onion, beef curry,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-18`,time:408,text:`and also a miso soup.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-19`,time:410,text:`The only difference was he got a salad and I didn't.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-20`,time:414,text:`I did not want to get a salad, so I went for the option that had no salad.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-21`,time:420,text:`And this cost around 8 Canadian dollars or I would say around 6 US dollars for this meal,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-22`,time:428,text:`which I think is quite a good deal for the quality and the convenience.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-23`,time:435,text:`And it was very fast, but we didn't get a drink.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-24`,time:438,text:`If we got a drink, it would have cost a bit more.`}]},{id:`part-4`,index:4,name:`Asakusa, the Temple, and an Underground Mall`,start:490,end:770,summary:`Photos from the second day show the crowded temple approach, its lantern and roof, Tokyo Skytree, a pork cutlet burger, and an old underground shopping street.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-1`,time:490,text:`Tell me guys, have you tried Japanese food before?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-2`,time:495,text:`me know in the comments. Now this is an image from our second day in Japan. We`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-3`,time:500,text:`were in the subway in this image heading to Asakusa to the oldest Buddhist`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-4`,time:507,text:`temple in Japan. Here you can see this is the entrance to that temple. We are`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-5`,time:515,text:`standing on the other side of the street and we had to cross the street to`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-6`,time:520,text:`get to the entrance and the entrance was very crowded. You can see there are a`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-7`,time:525,text:`a lot of people at the entrance and I believe this was probably one of the best first things to do in`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-8`,time:532,text:`Japan because it was just so traditional and so beautiful like really it was something I enjoyed`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-9`,time:538,text:`a lot. I have been here before when I was in Japan three years ago but I forgot just how`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-10`,time:545,text:`beautiful it is you know it's really beautiful. Here is a closer up photo of the giant lantern`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-11`,time:554,text:`in the entrance. I don't know if it's made of paper. I don't think it is. I didn't get close`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-12`,time:559,text:`enough to verify if it was made of paper or not, but I don't think it is made of paper. Here you`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-13`,time:568,text:`can see a lot of foreigners and Japanese people taking photos and admiring the entrance to the`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-14`,time:576,text:`temple. And this right here is the main pathway to the temple that you can see there are shops`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-15`,time:584,text:`or stores on each side and this area was very crowded. You can see there is just a sea`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-16`,time:592,text:`of people here. There was not really much room at all because this is one of the most`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-17`,time:598,text:`famous places to visit in Tokyo and it is a must-see destination. So it was very busy`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-18`,time:605,text:`but the atmosphere was nice and it was enjoyable.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-19`,time:611,text:`So this is a photo`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-20`,time:618,text:`of the temple. It is absolutely massive and beautiful. I think my favorite part of this`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-21`,time:625,text:`temple is the roof. I think the roof is beautiful and amazing and I like the way it is structured.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-22`,time:633,text:`The main color of the temple is red and red is my favorite color. So I enjoyed this temple.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-23`,time:640,text:`From the temple, you can see the Tokyo Skytree, Tokyo Skytree. This is an observation deck in`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-24`,time:648,text:`Tokyo where you can see the whole city. From this viewpoint, the city looks small or massive`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-25`,time:657,text:`depending on your perspective. But Tokyo, I believe, is one of the biggest cities in the world.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-26`,time:664,text:`It's absolutely massive and it just feels like that every time I come here. You can spend a`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-27`,time:671,text:`new day in a new neighborhood and never get tired, honestly. The neighborhoods or the cities are so`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-28`,time:678,text:`large and there is so much to do. This right here is something my brother got for lunch. It is a`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-29`,time:686,text:`burger, a pork cutlet tonkotsu burger and I didn't try it but he said it was one of the crispiest`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-30`,time:695,text:`and freshest burgers he has ever had which made me want to try it but`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-31`,time:700,text:`unfortunately I didn't want to try it in that moment`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-32`,time:704,text:`but I will go back and try it myself. This was at`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-33`,time:707,text:`Moss Burger. Moss Burger is a large fast food chain`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-34`,time:712,text:`here in Japan. They're similar to McDonald's`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-35`,time:716,text:`in that they sell burgers. Now this image right here is of the oldest`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-36`,time:722,text:`underground shopping mall in Japan the oldest underground shopping mall in Japan and I was`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-37`,time:729,text:`honestly quite surprised to find this and to see it. It wasn't really on my list of things to do`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-38`,time:736,text:`but when we were in Asakusa my brother mentioned oh the oldest shopping mall in Japan underground`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-39`,time:741,text:`shopping mall in Japan is here. Do you want to go check it out? To which I replied of course of`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-40`,time:747,text:`course it wasn't very big it was only a few hundred meters but it was really`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-41`,time:754,text:`cool the vibe was honestly amazing it was so old but so well kept and tidy`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-42`,time:760,text:`everything was nice and clean and I think it's mainly an area for drinking`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-43`,time:765,text:`since a lot of the shops were closed but they said bar on the outside so I`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-44`,time:770,text:`think at night they all opened up but we went there in the middle of the day`}]},{id:`part-5`,index:5,name:`Convenience-Store Snacks and Shopping`,start:775,end:964,summary:`The speaker tries noodles, chips, and FamilyMart chicken, sees a gun shop, and searches several electronics stores for a DJI microphone and a tax refund.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-1`,time:775,text:`Ah, now this picture you see this right here is my favorite time of day when we go to the convenience store and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-2`,time:782,text:`We buy food here. The first item you can see is a yakisobas`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-3`,time:787,text:`sandwich and I`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-4`,time:790,text:`Didn't try this. My brother got it. I personally don't think I would eat noodles inside a hot dog bun`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-5`,time:796,text:`But each to their own but we tried all these snacks. We really we got a lot of snacks`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-6`,time:800,text:`It was our lunch after we went to bueno park and the snacks were very good and I got these very good`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-7`,time:808,text:`Soy sauce noodles that I really enjoyed and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-8`,time:811,text:`What else did I get? Oh ice cream and chips pizza chips`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-9`,time:816,text:`This right here is the famous FamilyMart chicken`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-10`,time:823,text:`Fami chicken as they call it or famichiki`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-11`,time:825,text:`Unfortunately this one was not crispy so I don't think it was as good as it`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-12`,time:831,text:`could have been but I will say it was very very juicy. That is one thing I`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-13`,time:837,text:`cannot deny. The Family Mart chicken was incredibly juicy but it just wasn't`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-14`,time:842,text:`crispy. If it was crispy I would give this a very high score. Unfortunately`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-15`,time:847,text:`this one wasn't but I will go and try it again to try to get a crispy fresh`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-16`,time:852,text:`one. And this right here is a photo of a store that we saw selling guns. I don't`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-17`,time:858,text:`know if these guns work. I don't know if they have their firing pin, but it really`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-18`,time:863,text:`surprised me to see a gun store in Tokyo and in Japan in general because I`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-19`,time:868,text:`don't think police officers can even have guns. I really don't think they can`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-20`,time:872,text:`but I could be wrong. You can correct me in the comments. I don't think they can`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-21`,time:876,text:`have guns. So to see a gun store honestly surprised me but I feel like, and this`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-22`,time:881,text:`is my assumption it's just for like people like collectors that want to`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-23`,time:886,text:`collect guns and firearms because I don't think you can buy a firearm that`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-24`,time:890,text:`actually works so they probably have like the barrel cemented so it can't`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-25`,time:894,text:`fire any bullets and they probably have the firing pin removed and a lot of`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-26`,time:899,text:`stuff like that so I'm pretty sure it's just for people that want to collect`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-27`,time:904,text:`guns but regardless I found that quite interesting so I took a photo of it`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-28`,time:908,text:`And this photo right here is inside a huge electronics department store.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-29`,time:914,text:`My brother was looking for these mics, these DJI mics, and we went to three`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-30`,time:919,text:`department stores to try to find this. I believe this was in Akihabara. I think`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-31`,time:924,text:`they have a lot of like huge department stores where they sell electronics and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-32`,time:928,text:`stuff. So we we went there and we tried to find that mic and they did not have`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-33`,time:936,text:`it at the first one they did not have it at the second one can you guess if they`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-34`,time:941,text:`had it at the third one yes they had it at the third one so my brother was able`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-35`,time:946,text:`to buy it and he was also able to get a tax refund on it because in Japan if`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-36`,time:952,text:`you're a tourist and you're buying stuff you can get a tax refund so he was able`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-37`,time:957,text:`to also get I think a $15 discount not a discount but our tax refund immediately`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-38`,time:964,text:`which was quite nice because that makes the item you're buying cheaper. In this case, $15 cheaper.`}]},{id:`part-6`,index:6,name:`Currencies and Akihabara`,start:972,end:1152,summary:`A tax refund prompts a digression on currencies, Ecuador and the euro. The photos then return to Akihabara and its anime, games, and electronics stores.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-1`,time:972,text:`And what is a dollar? What is a dollar? For example, what is the dollar? Yen? Yuan? RM?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-2`,time:981,text:`What are those? Those are currencies. And each country has their own currency. For example,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-3`,time:990,text:`the United States has the US dollar and Canada has the Canadian dollar, the Canadian dollar.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-4`,time:997,text:`So those countries both have dollars, but they're different. Same thing with Australia,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-5`,time:1002,text:`they have the Australian dollar. And I think only Japan uses yen. China has the yuan.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-6`,time:1009,text:`I think they only use that, I could be wrong though. But there are also countries like Ecuador`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-7`,time:1015,text:`that use the currency from another country.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-8`,time:1018,text:`Ecuador uses the United States dollar.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-9`,time:1021,text:`There is no local currency in Ecuador`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-10`,time:1024,text:`and that was because in the past`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-11`,time:1026,text:`there was very rampant inflation`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-12`,time:1029,text:`and to combat inflation`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-13`,time:1030,text:`they ditched their currency`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-14`,time:1032,text:`which was the sukre at the time`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-15`,time:1034,text:`and they adopted the US dollar.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-16`,time:1036,text:`And since then the currency has been stable`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-17`,time:1038,text:`because they are unable to print money`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-18`,time:1041,text:`since they don't own the the power to print US dollars only the United States Federal Reserve`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-19`,time:1048,text:`holds that power so that's a way to keep inflation in check and the amount of money in circulation`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-20`,time:1054,text:`in check but one negative about that is they can't really print more money if the country needs`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-21`,time:1062,text:`more money say to combat a recession but that's getting into economics and I'm sure that's kind`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-22`,time:1068,text:`and I'm boring for you guys.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-23`,time:1070,text:`And now that I think of it,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-24`,time:1071,text:`there is another interesting group of countries`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-25`,time:1075,text:`that all use one currency.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-26`,time:1078,text:`Can you guys guess what large group of countries`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-27`,time:1081,text:`all use the same currency?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-28`,time:1083,text:`European countries, they use the euro, the euro.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-29`,time:1088,text:`I believe maybe some of them have their own currency.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-30`,time:1092,text:`I think when the UK was part of the European Union,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-31`,time:1096,text:`they had their own currency, which was the pound,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-32`,time:1098,text:`British pound, but I think for the most part European countries use the euro. They can't`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-33`,time:1104,text:`really control their monetary policy because they can't print cash if they need it. Anyway,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-34`,time:1111,text:`back to the images. This right here is a photo of Akihabara. Akihabara. I'm probably saying that`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-35`,time:1119,text:`wrong, honestly. I'm probably butchering that pronunciation, but I'm not Japanese, so give`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-36`,time:1125,text:`give me some grace but anyway this is like the anime and gaming neighborhood of`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-37`,time:1131,text:`Tokyo it is filled with large department stores selling everything`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-38`,time:1136,text:`everything you could think of from anime games electronics everything`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-39`,time:1142,text:`everything really gaming so if you like any of those things and you want to go`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-40`,time:1148,text:`shopping it's the place to go in in Tokyo and honestly you could spend your`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-41`,time:1152,text:`whole trip there. There is so much to see there. Now let's get into our third day`}]},{id:`part-7`,index:7,name:`Immersive Rooms at teamLab`,start:1157,end:1357,summary:`On day three, the speaker visits teamLab, describing its changing lights, giant white balls, living flowers, and admission price.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-1`,time:1157,text:`here in Tokyo. Our third day. The area around me has gone quite quiet. I just`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-2`,time:1164,text:`see two guys over there standing by the water but I think everyone went back`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-3`,time:1169,text:`to work and went back to school because it is now 1 p.m. so I feel like most`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-4`,time:1174,text:`people went back to what they were doing earlier. But this right here is`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-5`,time:1180,text:`is Team Labs Tokyo. Team Labs which is an immersive like immersive experience in`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-6`,time:1189,text:`Japan. It's like an immersive museum it's really something I highly recommend. Yes`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-7`,time:1195,text:`the admission tickets are a little on the pricey side they cost around 40 US`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-8`,time:1202,text:`dollars to to go but if you're able to I highly recommend it because it is one`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-9`,time:1209,text:`most unique experiences, you will get to experience. So this right here is a video of one of the`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-10`,time:1217,text:`exhibitions there. This is one of the most famous exhibitions and if you've ever watched any`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-11`,time:1223,text:`Japan vlogs or seen anyone go to Japan, they always post photos here and these are just like`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-12`,time:1229,text:`long led lights that go from floor to ceiling and they change colors and there's music and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-13`,time:1236,text:`And it's just like very beautiful and very immersive.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-14`,time:1240,text:`And you can take some very nice photos here,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-15`,time:1242,text:`which I mean, who doesn't like to take nice photos?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-16`,time:1245,text:`So it's a really popular thing to come and see.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-17`,time:1250,text:`And this room is one of my favorite rooms.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-18`,time:1254,text:`It's really, really nice.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-19`,time:1256,text:`Let me know in the comments`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-20`,time:1258,text:`if you have ever been to Team Labs`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-21`,time:1260,text:`and did you enjoy it or not?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-22`,time:1263,text:`Now here's my other favorite exhibition at Team Labs.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-23`,time:1266,text:`This is the white ballroom, as I call it.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-24`,time:1270,text:`I'm not sure the actual name,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-25`,time:1271,text:`but I just call it the white ballroom`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-26`,time:1272,text:`since it's filled with giant white balls.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-27`,time:1275,text:`So maybe I should call it the giant white ballroom.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-28`,time:1277,text:`But anyway, this room is very cool.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-29`,time:1280,text:`And also you can take very good`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-30`,time:1282,text:`and nice pictures here as well.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-31`,time:1284,text:`This is another place you'll see very often posted online`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-32`,time:1288,text:`when people go to Japan.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-33`,time:1289,text:`It's also a very nice spot to take photos.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-34`,time:1292,text:`So obviously people are going to post photos`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-35`,time:1294,text:`from here online.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-36`,time:1295,text:`And yes, I did take photos here as well.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-37`,time:1298,text:`Will I be posting them?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-38`,time:1299,text:`Probably not, probably not,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-39`,time:1301,text:`since I've already been to TeamLab,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-40`,time:1302,text:`so I don't really feel like I should post again`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-41`,time:1306,text:`since I've been there.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-42`,time:1329,text:`And this right here is the last room in Team Labs.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-43`,time:1332,text:`It's like the flower room.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-44`,time:1334,text:`These are real flowers.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-45`,time:1335,text:`They are alive and they are watered daily`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-46`,time:1339,text:`and they like rise and fall.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-47`,time:1343,text:`They rise and fall with the music`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-48`,time:1346,text:`and with sounds and stuff.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-49`,time:1347,text:`So you might go in one way, turn around`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-50`,time:1350,text:`and see that the path you came in is closed.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-51`,time:1354,text:`So that right there was my team labs experience.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-52`,time:1357,text:`Honestly, it was really nice and it was really beautiful.`}]},{id:`part-8`,index:8,name:`Japan So Far and a Clean-City Observation`,start:1365,end:1450,summary:`The speaker sums up the places visited, appreciates Japan’s tidy streets, and notes how hard it is to find a trash can.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-1`,time:1365,text:`So that's so far everything I've done in Japan`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-2`,time:1368,text:`and I've already seen a decent amount of stuff.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-3`,time:1371,text:`I went to a park, Asakusa, a giant Buddhist temple,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-4`,time:1375,text:`underground shopping mall, team labs.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-5`,time:1378,text:`I ate so much convenience store food.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-6`,time:1379,text:`eaten like three meals at community stores so far. I've uh what else have I done? Oh I've slept`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-7`,time:1387,text:`but yeah that's so far been my experience in Japan and I really I forgot how like tidy and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-8`,time:1393,text:`clean Japan is. It's very clean, very tidy, very orderly. Everything is very organized`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-9`,time:1399,text:`and that's one thing I like about Japan but another thing one thing I find like frustrating`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-10`,time:1405,text:`and a little bit annoying is that I can't find garbage cans anywhere unless it's in a convenience`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-11`,time:1411,text:`store. It's very it's very annoying because I'm like carrying my garbage for hours and hours and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-12`,time:1418,text:`hours looking for a convenience store but I mean out of all the things that could be bad it's kind`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-13`,time:1424,text:`of like one of the lesser things so it's not really a big deal it's just like a very tiny thing`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-14`,time:1429,text:`but I guess that keeps the city clean and honestly I'm surprised it does keep the city`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-15`,time:1434,text:`so clean because if there are no garbage cans you think people would just throw their trash`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-16`,time:1439,text:`on the street but no one does. Maybe tourists too but honestly I don't really see trash at all on`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-17`,time:1444,text:`the streets anywhere which I do really appreciate and I think that's like a very good quality of`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-18`,time:1450,text:`Japan. It's just so clean, tidy, orderly and yeah I enjoy that part.`}]}]},{materialId:`1111-超市购物视频`,date:`2026-11-11`,dir:`1111`,title:`Listen and Shadow as We Buy Everyday Groceries`,sourceUrl:`https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_boen7zCMg`,duration:`00:25:24`,chapters:[{id:`part-1`,index:1,name:`Entering the Grocery Store`,start:49,end:144,summary:`We head down into an underground Wumart grocery store in Beijing and pass a food court at the entrance. As we walk, we talk about drinks, watermelon, papaya, the small shopping carts, and egg prices.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-1`,time:49,text:`Let's go in and get started. Okay, so we are now going down`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-2`,time:56,text:`into the Chinese grocery store.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-1`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-wumart-entrance-0053.jpg`,alt:`物美超市入口招牌（原视频 00:53）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-3`,time:58,text:`This grocery store is underground,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-4`,time:60,text:`and Wumart is the biggest chain here in Beijing,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-5`,time:64,text:`and I believe it is from Beijing, Wumart.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-2`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-wumart-underground-0104.jpg`,alt:`地下入口的物美标识（原视频 01:04）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-6`,time:67,text:`Although most people now just buy their groceries online.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-7`,time:70,text:`It looks like there's a food court here in the beginning.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-8`,time:73,text:`You can see a food court,`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-3`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-entrance-food-court.jpg`,alt:`入口处的美食广场与超市方向（01:10）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-9`,time:75,text:`and over there is the grocery store.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-4`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-grocery-store-0115.jpg`,alt:`镜头指向左侧超市入口（原视频 01:15；画面带有原片推广浮层）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-10`,time:77,text:`You wanna get something to eat first?`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-5`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-thirsty-food-court-0122.jpg`,alt:`美食广场里讨论是否买饮料（原视频 01:22）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-11`,time:79,text:`Let me check the time.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-12`,time:80,text:`11.45.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-13`,time:82,text:`I'm kind of thirsty.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-14`,time:83,text:`Yeah, we can get like a milk tea or something`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-15`,time:86,text:`to drink inside. We could just get a drink from here. I mean we're going to the`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-16`,time:90,text:`grocery store anyway. So now let's go into Wumart. Okay first things first`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-17`,time:94,text:`they're selling you half a watermelon with a spork`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-6`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-half-watermelon.jpg`,alt:`带叉勺的半个西瓜与切面（01:35）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-18`,time:98,text:`but why does it look like they chopped it in half with their hand you know it's not like clean-cut.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-19`,time:101,text:`Usually when a watermelon is full of sugar you just tap it and it splits so`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-20`,time:106,text:`that's probably what happened here. Here they have some too that's actually`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-21`,time:109,text:`interesting I guess it's kind of like a bowl but in the beginning here they`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-22`,time:113,text:`a bunch of fruit. What's that? No idea. What's that? Is this a mango? Oh no this is a papaya.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-7`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-papaya.jpg`,alt:`黄色网套中的木瓜（01:59）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-23`,time:120,text:`This is what the grocery store looks like.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-8`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-grocery-interior-0200.jpg`,alt:`超市生鲜区全景（原视频 02:00）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-24`,time:125,text:`And the shopping carts are actually like miniature. Like I don't know if you can tell on camera but they are quite small. Anyway let's walk through the grocery`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-9`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-miniature-cart.jpg`,alt:`与人手和地面形成尺寸对比的小购物车（02:03）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-25`,time:129,text:`store here. Here they have eggs. So for 30 eggs it's about three to four US dollars. I think`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-26`,time:136,text:`I think these are eggs too, but like premium.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-27`,time:139,text:`Oh, they're like gifts.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-28`,time:140,text:`That looks like a gift, you know?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-1-s-29`,time:142,text:`Like a gift package.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-1-img-10`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part1-egg-gift-boxes.jpg`,alt:`普通鸡蛋旁带提绳的红色鸡蛋礼盒（02:19）`}]},{id:`part-2`,index:2,name:`Fresh Produce Section`,start:144,end:250,summary:`We look at the shapes of cucumbers, peppers, and eggplants. A slower scene description then covers shopping lists, choosing fresh produce, comparing prices, and promotions.`,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-1`,time:144,text:`Here we are in the produce area.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-2`,time:146,text:`Is this the one that they smash`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-2-img-1`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part2-smashed-cucumber-0227.jpg`,alt:`货架上的黄瓜与拍黄瓜示意画面（原视频 02:27）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-3`,time:147,text:`and make that salad out of?`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-2-img-2`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part2-cucumber-salad-0231.jpg`,alt:`货架黄瓜与拍黄瓜沙拉示意画面（原视频 02:31）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-4`,time:149,text:`I think so, yeah.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-5`,time:150,text:`Have you seen it?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-6`,time:150,text:`It's like viral on like TikTok.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-7`,time:151,text:`But most cucumbers are like a little bit spiky.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-8`,time:155,text:`Yeah, I think so,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-9`,time:156,text:`but now they've genetically modified them`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-10`,time:158,text:`so they aren't spiky anymore.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-11`,time:160,text:`These are some very weirdly shaped peppers.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-2-img-3`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part2-irregular-peppers-0241.jpg`,alt:`弯曲且形状不规则的青椒（原视频 02:41）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-12`,time:162,text:`Look at the shape of this thing.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-13`,time:165,text:`This is what we get in North America.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-2-img-4`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part2-pepper-comparison-0245.jpg`,alt:`不规则青椒与较圆的青椒并排对比（原视频 02:45）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-14`,time:166,text:`It looks more like this, not like this.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-15`,time:168,text:`What's this, a banana pepper?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-16`,time:170,text:`They have beans.`},{kind:`image`,id:`part-2-img-5`,src:`../../materials-assets/1111/part2-beans-0249.jpg`,alt:`货架上的豆角（原视频约 02:49.8）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-17`,time:171,text:`What's that?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-18`,time:172,text:`It's like a squished eggplant.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-19`,time:174,text:`Yeah, honestly, it probably is an eggplant`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-20`,time:176,text:`because the eggplant is right across from it.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-21`,time:177,text:`Oh, true, yeah, it looks exactly like that,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-22`,time:179,text:`but just in ball form.`},{kind:`subheading`,id:`part-2-sub-1`,text:`Scene Description and Shopping English（03:02–04:10）`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-23`,time:182,text:`Here we are inside the fresh produce section`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-24`,time:185,text:`of a grocery store in China.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-25`,time:188,text:`The store is spacious, brightly lit,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-26`,time:190,text:`and organized into different sections.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-27`,time:194,text:`People usually visit grocery stores to buy food`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-28`,time:197,text:`and household supplies for the next few days or for the entire week.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-29`,time:203,text:`They may create a shopping list beforehand, compare different brands, check expiration`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-30`,time:208,text:`dates, and examine fresh produce carefully.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-31`,time:212,text:`Some shoppers buy only what they need, while others fill an entire cart.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-32`,time:218,text:`Prices can vary depending on the brand, quality, season, and size of the package.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-33`,time:224,text:`Fresh produce is sometimes sold by weight, so the final cost depends on how much a customer`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-34`,time:230,text:`selects.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-35`,time:232,text:`Many grocery stores also offer sales and special promotions.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-36`,time:236,text:`A discounted item costs less than its regular price, while a promotion may encourage customers`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-37`,time:242,text:`to buy several items together.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-2-s-38`,time:245,text:`Checking prices carefully can help shoppers save money and avoid unnecessary purchases.`}]},{id:`part-3`,index:3,name:``,start:250,end:363,summary:``,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-1`,time:250,text:`Is that tea or alcohol?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-2`,time:252,text:`Baijo.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-3`,time:253,text:`Baijo?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-4`,time:254,text:`Yeah.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-5`,time:255,text:`What is that?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-6`,time:256,text:`It's like Chinese rice wine.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-7`,time:258,text:`Chinese rice wine?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-8`,time:259,text:`It's like soju.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-9`,time:260,text:`Exactly.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-10`,time:261,text:`Oh, what's this?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-11`,time:262,text:`This is rock sugar.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-12`,time:264,text:`Rock sugar?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-13`,time:265,text:`Sugar?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-14`,time:266,text:`Yeah.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-15`,time:268,text:`Damn.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-16`,time:268,text:`So you can just self-serve yourself.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-17`,time:270,text:`Sugar, rice, beans.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-18`,time:272,text:`Here's the OG soybeans.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-19`,time:274,text:`Soybeans.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-20`,time:274,text:`This is what unprocessed soybeans look like.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-21`,time:276,text:`And over here you have...`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-22`,time:278,text:`Is that Kugusan?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-23`,time:280,text:`like Beijing style Beijing smoked chicken that's like vacuum sealed you have like sausage and other`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-24`,time:286,text:`stuff that sausage looks very similar to Ukrainian sausage that's looks like salami they have like`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-25`,time:291,text:`another half chicken there oh my gosh dude this stuff is amazing this this we're gonna get this`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-26`,time:300,text:`let me get get the 20 pack or I'll just get a big bottle well you'll find uh where the drinks are`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-27`,time:306,text:`over there somewhere yeah I'll get a big bottle but this this is really good this tea I recommend`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-28`,time:311,text:`that. Okay so here we have some walnuts. Walnuts are very popular and these ones`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-29`,time:316,text:`are toasted walnuts. These ones are not toasted. I just guessed that. Here you`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-30`,time:321,text:`have some dates. It looks like it's right. They do look toasted. They've got`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-31`,time:325,text:`like some char on them. These right here are dates. Oh ice cream. Dude is that pea`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-32`,time:329,text:`bean flavored ice cream? The green bean flavor? What? They have bean flavor`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-33`,time:335,text:`ice cream bruh. I always see people have that one. What's another popular one`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-34`,time:339,text:`You always see that one right there that one with the cow. Oh, yeah. Yeah people always have no one Olympic one. Yeah`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-35`,time:346,text:`What else do they got here some corn dogs that ice cream flavor looks very interesting`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-36`,time:352,text:`Look at that one. Yeah, the pea flavor. Hell no`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-37`,time:356,text:`Oh people also have that one a lot. I see that one a lot on the street`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-3-s-38`,time:361,text:`And this is like a frozen section`}]},{id:`part-4`,index:4,name:``,start:434,end:696,summary:``,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-1`,time:434,text:`A lot of yogurt, at least the yogurt and milk is in the fridge.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-2`,time:437,text:`I've seen a lot of countries that don't do that, which I find weird since in Canada`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-3`,time:442,text:`we do.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-4`,time:443,text:`section and it's very interesting to me that they also like crawfish because`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-5`,time:447,text:`that's like a southern thing. I haven't really seen it outside of the States but`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-6`,time:451,text:`I've seen it a lot here in Beijing crawfish. I've seen it almost everywhere.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-7`,time:456,text:`I've seen like crepe fish hotpot restaurants. Yeah. But they just sell that.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-8`,time:460,text:`Yeah and here they have the pre-sliced beef for you. That's convenient.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-9`,time:464,text:`So we've got one of these. This is like the most famous chili oil, Lao Gong Ma.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-10`,time:470,text:`Maybe ask the viewers what the difference is with this one.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-11`,time:474,text:`I know it's got like a green stripe and it says 0% here,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-12`,time:477,text:`so maybe this is like less oil or less salt or something.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-13`,time:481,text:`Yeah, what's the difference between those two?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-14`,time:483,text:`But I'm guessing that that one's the original.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-15`,time:485,text:`Yeah, we'll take that one, just in case.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-16`,time:488,text:`Okay, you guys, so we've got two packs of noodles here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-17`,time:491,text:`This one is beef sour cabbage`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-18`,time:494,text:`and this one is braised beef noodle.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-19`,time:496,text:`I know that cabbage one's gonna be good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-20`,time:498,text:`That cabbage one is going to be fire, because I don't know.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-21`,time:501,text:`I love sour things with beef.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-22`,time:503,text:`So I think that will be very good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-23`,time:505,text:`But yeah, this is the dry noodle section.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-24`,time:508,text:`But I think that's good enough for noodles.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-25`,time:510,text:`We do have a whole list of stuff that we want to get.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-26`,time:513,text:`Okay, so over here is the chocolate bar section.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-27`,time:516,text:`I think this is a Chinese brand, right?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-28`,time:518,text:`Dove.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-29`,time:519,text:`In North America, Dove is a soap brand.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-30`,time:521,text:`Oh, porridge?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-31`,time:522,text:`Oh no, those are just oats.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-32`,time:524,text:`It's not porridge.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-33`,time:525,text:`Like in South Africa,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-34`,time:525,text:`they have like really good porridge flavors, you know?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-35`,time:528,text:`Here's your white rabbit a white rabbit. Yeah, I found her right there. Okay. Do you guys know what this is white rabbit candy?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-36`,time:535,text:`I believe this is the most like famous Chinese candy ever if you're Chinese you definitely recognize this`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-37`,time:542,text:`White rabbit. I think I'll also get some dove. Let's get a mint dove and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-38`,time:548,text:`A white chocolate dove. Let's get these two as well. Put those in there. What else should we get?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-39`,time:554,text:`You think some of these Chinese porridges would be good? Look at that blueberry or blackberry porridge or this one`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-40`,time:561,text:`Lotus porridge or this one corn porridge`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-41`,time:565,text:`Dude corn would actually be good. That looks like that self-African one. That looks like cassava`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-42`,time:570,text:`It's corn and cassava. That one actually looks really good. So these are all just packages here and it looks like it's porridge`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-43`,time:578,text:`Okay this is something, oh these two. This is something I've really been looking for,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-44`,time:583,text:`and it's this. Oh man, someone recommended this to me and they said that if you like coconut milk,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-45`,time:590,text:`then get this. And also this is like a very controversial brand because of their marketing.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-46`,time:594,text:`I mean as you can see, I'm sure you can tell why, but they say this is the best one,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-47`,time:598,text:`so I'm going to definitely get this. So we've added a few more items to our cart.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-48`,time:603,text:`We've added these, these, some QQ gummies,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-49`,time:607,text:`white rabbit you already saw, and also these.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-50`,time:612,text:`But I think I'm going to get a can to go.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-51`,time:615,text:`Too bad it's not cold. Let me try it.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-52`,time:619,text:`We'll also get one of these, a can of these to try.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-53`,time:623,text:`Put that in here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-54`,time:625,text:`Over here we have all the chips' flavors.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-55`,time:628,text:`So you can see they have a bunch of unique flavors.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-56`,time:631,text:`For example, cucumber, Italian red meat flavor.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-57`,time:635,text:`Texas grilled barbecue flavor, Mexican chicken tomato flavor, kimchi flavor, like there are so`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-58`,time:641,text:`many flavors here. Here they have more roasted seaweed flavor. They have a lot of options here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-59`,time:646,text:`Okay so we kind of just went through the whole store on that side and now we're at the drink`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-60`,time:652,text:`section. We're gonna get a cold drink. I know this drink is very popular and it's good. I've`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-61`,time:656,text:`had it. It's like iced tea but my favorite drink here is, let me just find it, my favorite drink`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-62`,time:663,text:`here is not cold.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-63`,time:666,text:`They didn't put it in the fridge,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-64`,time:667,text:`so there's no cold one.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-65`,time:669,text:`That's sad.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-66`,time:670,text:`Okay, so this is our shopping cart.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-67`,time:672,text:`You can see it's really small.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-68`,time:673,text:`Now you can see it's small.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-69`,time:674,text:`You can push it.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-70`,time:675,text:`Outside of that, our Leon is really big.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-71`,time:677,text:`But anyway.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-72`,time:678,text:`Jack.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-73`,time:681,text:`Oh!`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-74`,time:681,text:`Watch out, dog.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-75`,time:682,text:`Watch out for the robot.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-76`,time:684,text:`Hello.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-77`,time:685,text:`What about ice cream?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-78`,time:686,text:`Oh, for real.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-79`,time:687,text:`You think they got that mango scene ice cream`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-80`,time:689,text:`that we missed last time?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-81`,time:690,text:`Yeah, right there.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-82`,time:691,text:`Ooh, low key.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-83`,time:692,text:`Have we eaten anything today?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-4-s-84`,time:694,text:`I think we deserve an ice cream.`}]},{id:`part-5`,index:5,name:``,start:696,end:725,summary:``,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-1`,time:696,text:`Okay, so now we're checking out.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-2`,time:698,text:`We lowkey bought a lot.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-3`,time:704,text:`You think you could fit this all on a bike?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-4`,time:709,text:`I'll give you a hand with the bagging.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-5`,time:714,text:`Put the heavy stuff on the bottom.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-6`,time:716,text:`Yeah, weren't you a bagger once?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-5-s-7`,time:718,text:`Never.`}]},{id:`part-6`,index:6,name:``,start:725,end:872,summary:``,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-1`,time:725,text:`Okay guys, so we just finished shopping.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-2`,time:727,text:`You can see we have all our shopping beside us.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-3`,time:731,text:`I'll actually try this while I eat.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-4`,time:733,text:`I think this is probably one of the coolest packaging I've ever seen.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-5`,time:737,text:`I'm not gonna lie.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-6`,time:738,text:`What was the controversy?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-7`,time:739,text:`It's because it was very sexual.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-8`,time:741,text:`So they got sued a lot of times for that.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-9`,time:743,text:`For what?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-10`,time:744,text:`For the packaging, I guess, because it's not conservative.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-11`,time:747,text:`But anyway, this is what we got for lunch.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-12`,time:750,text:`This is braised pork with a little soup on the side.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-13`,time:753,text:`We both got the same thing.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-14`,time:755,text:`And right now, we're just sitting in this food court.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-15`,time:757,text:`Dude, look at this.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-16`,time:758,text:`You can get a five-gallon jug of coconut water.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-17`,time:762,text:`Yeah, this one is, I hope it's coconut milk.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-18`,time:764,text:`Hope it's coconut milk,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-19`,time:765,text:`so I thought it was coconut milk.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-20`,time:766,text:`Hopefully that's what it is.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-21`,time:768,text:`Well, we're about to find out,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-22`,time:769,text:`but anyway, we're sitting inside this food court.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-23`,time:771,text:`Yeah, it's a little dim, but.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-24`,time:772,text:`But it's the vibes.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-25`,time:773,text:`It's a nice vibe.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-26`,time:774,text:`It's quiet.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-27`,time:775,text:`Let's try this food.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-28`,time:776,text:`This is the plate.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-29`,time:777,text:`Let's try it.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-30`,time:778,text:`Try it right at one through 10.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-31`,time:779,text:`One bite, everyone knows the rules.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-32`,time:785,text:`Okay.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-33`,time:786,text:`Now let's mix it up.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-34`,time:787,text:`They put a lot in here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-35`,time:788,text:`Oh yeah.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-36`,time:789,text:`They put a lot.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-37`,time:790,text:`We have a soy sauce egg.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-38`,time:795,text:`Also, this is like the sausage we saw in the grocery store.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-39`,time:798,text:`I wanted to try the sausage.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-40`,time:799,text:`It looks like Kuba soft.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-41`,time:800,text:`Yeah, it's literally 99% Kuba soft, but it's good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-42`,time:803,text:`It goes well with everything.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-43`,time:804,text:`It's salty.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-44`,time:805,text:`I wish it was a little bit sweeter.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-45`,time:807,text:`Yeah, that's where the pickled radish comes in,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-46`,time:810,text:`just as that sweetness.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-47`,time:812,text:`I hope it's coconut milk,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-48`,time:813,text:`because I've been under the impression`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-49`,time:815,text:`that it's coconut milk.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-50`,time:816,text:`I like coconut water, but only if it's cold,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-51`,time:818,text:`so I really hope it's not coconut water.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-52`,time:820,text:`Oh no, it's milk.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-53`,time:822,text:`Thank God.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-54`,time:823,text:`I was a little bit scared,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-55`,time:824,text:`because this is like clearly coconut water.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-56`,time:826,text:`But this you can see the inside.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-57`,time:828,text:`Oh yeah, that's white.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-58`,time:832,text:`And you know how they make coconut milk?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-59`,time:835,text:`They just blend up the coconut.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-60`,time:837,text:`Exactly, yeah, they blend it as much as they can`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-61`,time:840,text:`and they strain the chunks from it.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-62`,time:843,text:`Holy, that's good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-63`,time:845,text:`If this was cold, man, if it tastes this good warm,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-64`,time:849,text:`try that, that is some good stuff.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-65`,time:852,text:`Wow, smells a little bit like coconut.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-66`,time:862,text:`That's really good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-67`,time:862,text:`I think there's a little bit of sugar added,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-68`,time:864,text:`but that's pretty natural.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-69`,time:866,text:`And if it was cold, man, that'd be so good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-6-s-70`,time:868,text:`Good thing we bought like two large containers of that.`}]},{id:`part-7`,index:7,name:``,start:872,end:920,summary:``,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-1`,time:872,text:`Okay, so that was the grocery store we went to,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-2`,time:875,text:`and now we're leaving.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-3`,time:877,text:`I don't know how we're gonna bring this home`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-4`,time:879,text:`because we only have a bicycle,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-5`,time:880,text:`so we're gonna check if this could fit in the basket.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-6`,time:883,text:`On the bicycle, since we only have one bag.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-7`,time:886,text:`Yeah.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-8`,time:886,text:`I don't know about you guys, but I would say it fits.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-9`,time:889,text:`I'll just have to hold it here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-10`,time:890,text:`Leon's over there, maybe I'll give him some stuff,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-11`,time:892,text:`but I would say overall this is not too bad.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-12`,time:895,text:`You can see there are just a bunch of bikes here`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-13`,time:896,text:`and this is something I love about China.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-14`,time:898,text:`You can just rent a bike anywhere.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-15`,time:900,text:`You just have to scan this QR code`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-16`,time:902,text:`and it's just so convenient.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-17`,time:904,text:`And it's a lot of the time faster than public transportation`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-18`,time:907,text:`or taking the Metro or bus`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-19`,time:909,text:`because the bikes are just everywhere`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-20`,time:911,text:`and it's just very convenient.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-21`,time:912,text:`But anyway, that's where the Wumart was.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-22`,time:916,text:`And now we're gonna head home back to our hotel`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-7-s-23`,time:918,text:`so we can drop this off and then continue shopping.`}]},{id:`part-8`,index:8,name:``,start:920,end:1378,summary:``,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-1`,time:920,text:`Okay guys, so we got all the goods behind me, as you can see,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-2`,time:924,text:`and we're gonna go through each and every one of the items`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-3`,time:927,text:`we bought at the grocery store in Beijing.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-4`,time:930,text:`Let's start over here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-5`,time:932,text:`As you can see here, we got four cans of Lay's chips.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-6`,time:938,text:`These look very similar to Pringles.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-7`,time:941,text:`We'll go through everything in detail here,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-8`,time:943,text:`but I'll give you a quick overview.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-9`,time:944,text:`So we got some Lay's chips, some coconut milk,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-10`,time:947,text:`Ramen noodles, tofu snacks, spicy sticks,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-11`,time:951,text:`more ramen, more chips,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-12`,time:952,text:`and some traditional Chinese snacks here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-13`,time:955,text:`So most of the items I have behind me`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-14`,time:957,text:`are very popular traditional Chinese snacks`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-15`,time:961,text:`and chips flavors.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-16`,time:963,text:`All of these were recommended by the internet,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-17`,time:965,text:`by Chachibiti, and by DeepSeek AI.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-18`,time:968,text:`So all of this stuff was recommended`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-19`,time:971,text:`through various sources online.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-20`,time:973,text:`Some of the stuff I got`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-21`,time:974,text:`because I thought it would taste good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-22`,time:975,text:`Let's start over here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-23`,time:977,text:`cucumber flavored chips.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-24`,time:980,text:`I have never seen this anywhere else in the world,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-25`,time:983,text:`except for in China.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-26`,time:984,text:`You guys can let me know if you've ever seen this`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-27`,time:985,text:`in your home country, but I'm pretty sure`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-28`,time:987,text:`this is from China.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-29`,time:988,text:`And I have tried them, and contrary to logical thinking,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-30`,time:992,text:`it does not taste like water.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-31`,time:993,text:`It tastes like slightly sweet.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-32`,time:995,text:`It doesn't taste like cucumber in my opinion,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-33`,time:997,text:`because cucumber is like 90% water or something like that.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-34`,time:1e3,text:`Then we got barbecue flavor.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-35`,time:1002,text:`You can kind of hear, I think some of the chips cracked`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-36`,time:1009,text:`because we brought them on a plane.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-37`,time:1010,text:`But here we have roasted seaweed flavor.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-38`,time:1013,text:`This one sounds like it really broke up.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-39`,time:1016,text:`I'm not even sure.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-40`,time:1017,text:`Can you guys translate that for me?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-41`,time:1020,text:`What flavor is this?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-42`,time:1021,text:`It looks like some sort of like flat Chinese pancake`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-43`,time:1024,text:`or something, but yeah.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-44`,time:1026,text:`Then we have candied walnuts.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-45`,time:1027,text:`So these are walnuts covered or coated`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-46`,time:1031,text:`in a thin layer of sugar.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-47`,time:1033,text:`So you could call them candied walnuts.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-48`,time:1035,text:`These should be really good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-49`,time:1037,text:`Here we have some noodles.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-50`,time:1038,text:`These are thick and chewy noodles.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-51`,time:1040,text:`can see these noodles are thick. They're not thin noodles, they're thick and it`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-52`,time:1045,text:`comes in a container. So you just need to pour water in this container and then`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-53`,time:1049,text:`close the lid for a couple minutes and it'll be ready. You don't need to get a`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-54`,time:1053,text:`separate bowl like you do with these. With this pack of ramen, you need to`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-55`,time:1058,text:`take out the individual packet and get a bowl and then put hot water in that`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-56`,time:1062,text:`bowl and make it like that as you see in the image. This one you don't need`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-57`,time:1066,text:`because it comes with a bowl. This package is a beautiful purple color and`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-58`,time:1070,text:`the flavor is beef sour cabbage. I have tried it because I bought a small bowl`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-59`,time:1076,text:`to try and it was very good. So I do like these ones a lot and I like the`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-60`,time:1080,text:`color of this packaging. It's very nice. I like this type of purple. This is a`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-61`,time:1086,text:`very popular Chinese coconut milk as well. I'm sure if you're Chinese you`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-62`,time:1090,text:`have had this and apparently it's very controversial as well because of the`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-63`,time:1094,text:`advertising as you can see here, but I tried it and it is quite good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-64`,time:1098,text:`I like coconut milk, you can't really go wrong.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-65`,time:1101,text:`Let me know, do you like coconut milk or not?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-66`,time:1105,text:`Here we just have some sunflower seeds.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-67`,time:1107,text:`I'm sure everyone knows what these are.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-68`,time:1108,text:`In Canada, we have a sunflower seed brand called Spitz and they're`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-69`,time:1112,text:`flavored and they are very, very good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-70`,time:1115,text:`And in Canada, the way we eat sunflower seeds is we take like a handful,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-71`,time:1120,text:`not a huge handful, but a decent handful and we put it all in our mouth`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-72`,time:1123,text:`and we put them to one side, and then you suck on them to get the flavor`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-73`,time:1126,text:`because we have barbecue flavor, all seasoned salt, salt and pepper.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-74`,time:1132,text:`We have many different flavors, and you put it to one side,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-75`,time:1134,text:`and then when you want to eat one, you bring it to the other side of your mouth,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-76`,time:1137,text:`you crack it, take the seed out, eat the seed and spit out the shell.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-77`,time:1141,text:`That's how we do it in Canada.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-78`,time:1142,text:`But I have seen other people, they just bite it and take the seed out.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-79`,time:1144,text:`Bite it one at a time and take the seed out.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-80`,time:1146,text:`In Canada, I guess we're skilled or maybe other parts of the world also do that.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-81`,time:1152,text:`Here we have some spicy nuts, spicy, spicy, and here we have, I think, the most famous chili oil in`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-82`,time:1161,text:`China, Laogon Ma or something. It's this grandma, as you can see. But I don't think I've ever really`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-83`,time:1168,text:`tried this before, so I'm really looking forward to trying this. And if you guys want to see me`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-84`,time:1172,text:`try all this stuff, let me know in the comments and I'll make a video. So we're done on that side.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-85`,time:1176,text:`Now let's go over to this side over here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-86`,time:1180,text:`Here we have some more noodles.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-87`,time:1183,text:`This one is just, I think, braised beef noodles.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-88`,time:1185,text:`You can see the package is bright red.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-89`,time:1187,text:`My favorite color is red.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-90`,time:1190,text:`So my favorite color is red.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-91`,time:1192,text:`So I like this packaging.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-92`,time:1193,text:`Tell me, do you have a favorite color?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-93`,time:1195,text:`What is it?`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-94`,time:1196,text:`Let me know in the comments.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-95`,time:1198,text:`And also to answer these questions, you can take your phone, record yourself and answer`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-96`,time:1203,text:`the question.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-97`,time:1204,text:`you can track your pronunciation progress as you go on. Next, we have another bag of chips here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-98`,time:1210,text:`This one is Texas Grilled Barbecue Flavor. I did see a lot of like Texas and like American`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-99`,time:1215,text:`flavored chips, which I found quite interesting, but I got this to try as well. Over here,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-100`,time:1221,text:`I know this is very popular as well in China. It's hawthorn, hawthorn. That's what it looks`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-101`,time:1229,text:`like. It's really popular. They come in rolls or in like these discs. And I just got the disc one,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-102`,time:1235,text:`but these are very popular as well. And I like the packaging. The packaging is very simple and clean.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-103`,time:1241,text:`I think this is the most famous candy. White Rabbit. You could see I opened up the packaging`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-104`,time:1248,text:`here and I tried one. It's very hard. It's very hard. I will say that the candy, I don't know`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-105`,time:1255,text:`if you have to just suck it or you chew it, but I did notice it's quite a hard candy.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-106`,time:1260,text:`It does get softer as you chew it, but it's not hard like a Jolly Rancher or something,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-107`,time:1265,text:`but it's not soft either, like a Starburst. But yeah, I think these are the most famous`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-108`,time:1270,text:`Chinese candy, White Rabbit. But I did like it. It was a little bit creamy. It was pretty good.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-109`,time:1276,text:`I did like this one. Over here, another very popular snack. I believe this is`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-110`,time:1281,text:`squid. I could be wrong, but I believe this is squid. Here, I know these are very popular too.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-111`,time:1288,text:`This is like, uh, spicy sticks. I'm not really sure what this is made out of. I tried it.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-112`,time:1293,text:`You can check out my other video where I tried a bunch of convenience store food in China.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-113`,time:1297,text:`I tried this. I'm not a fan, but my brother, I guess he loves it because he was just eating it`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-114`,time:1301,text:`in the hotel room after he was just eating them. And I'm like, not really my thing, you know,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-115`,time:1306,text:`not really my thing, but yeah, he liked this one. What else do we got? Oh, these ones.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-116`,time:1311,text:`Pickled pepper bamboo shoots. I bought this one at 7-Eleven because I couldn't find this`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-117`,time:1316,text:`in any of the grocery stores I went to.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-118`,time:1319,text:`I went to the Moo Mart, I believe it was called,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-119`,time:1327,text:`and also to to another one.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-120`,time:1330,text:`I went to another really big one, but I couldn't find these.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-121`,time:1332,text:`But when I was in 7-Eleven, I found them.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-122`,time:1334,text:`So I'm going to try these two.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-123`,time:1336,text:`And the last few snacks we have are all pretty similar.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-124`,time:1340,text:`These are like tofu snacks.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-125`,time:1341,text:`I believe this one is tofu and chicken, tofu and chicken and mushroom.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-126`,time:1345,text:`This one is dry tofu, dry tofu.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-127`,time:1350,text:`This one is, oh yeah, this is the store I bought these from, with the cow.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-128`,time:1353,text:`This one is marinated tofu spicy flavor.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-129`,time:1357,text:`And this last one is juicy burst mountain delicacy tofu.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-130`,time:1362,text:`So I believe those are all the snacks I got.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-131`,time:1365,text:`You guys can see it doesn't look like a lot of snacks, but this took up about half of my suitcase.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-132`,time:1370,text:`So I got all these snacks. I will definitely try them all if you guys want to see a video on that.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-8-s-133`,time:1374,text:`Let me know in the comments, but tell me, out of all these snacks,`}]},{id:`part-9`,index:9,name:``,start:1378,end:1488,summary:``,blocks:[{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-1`,time:1378,text:`Which ones have you tried and which snacks are your favorite? We will now have a shadowing segment here.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-2`,time:1385,text:`Here we can see all the food and snacks we bought during our grocery trip in China.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-3`,time:1392,text:`Everything is spread out on the bed so we can look at it clearly. There is a wide mix of items including chips,`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-4`,time:1400,text:`crackers, instant noodles, packaged snacks, drinks, and a few products that are unfamiliar to us.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-5`,time:1406,text:`The colorful packaging immediately stands out and makes the whole scene look exciting.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-6`,time:1413,text:`A grocery store usually offers a broader selection than a convenience store.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-7`,time:1418,text:`Instead of only selling quick snacks and drinks, grocery stores often have a larger variety of`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-8`,time:1424,text:`packaged foods, household items, cooking ingredients, and everyday necessities.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-9`,time:1430,text:`In this scene, we can see that we did not buy just one type of product.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-10`,time:1435,text:`We picked up several different snacks and foods so we could try a range of flavors.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-11`,time:1441,text:`Some items look savory while others seem sweet or spicy.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-12`,time:1446,text:`We have potato chips in canisters, bagged snacks, instant noodle cups, and other packaged foods`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-13`,time:1453,text:`that may have very different textures.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-14`,time:1456,text:`Some will probably be crunchy and salty while others may be soft, chewy, or strongly seasoned.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-15`,time:1464,text:`That variety is part of what makes grocery shopping in another country so interesting.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-16`,time:1470,text:`Looking at everything together feels satisfying because it shows how much we found in one trip.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-17`,time:1475,text:`It is also a fun way to compare products, notice the packaging, and get ready to taste things we have never tried before.`},{kind:`sentence`,id:`part-9-s-18`,time:1484,text:`This scene feels like the beginning of a food adventure.`}]}]}]};export{e as t};